{"name":"蔓生灌木","category":"tfc:farming_plus","icon":"tfcfarmingplus:food/goji","pages":[{"type":"patchouli:text","text":"本模组新增 8 种蔓生灌木：浆果灌木，以及茶树与咖啡树。长成后会向四周与上方伸出枝叶。$(br2)在合适土壤与气候下种植，生长按TFC配置计时；结果期右键采收，采后遵守开花冷却。锋利工具可回收主丛，蔓生幼株有概率；枝段掉木棍。南半球换季。自然株需在新生成区块寻找。"},{"type":"patchouli:empty"},{"type":"tfc:table","strings":[{"text":""},{"text":"Jan"},{"text":"Feb"},{"text":"Mar"},{"text":"Apr"},{"text":"May"},{"text":"Jun"},{"text":"Jul"},{"text":"Aug"},{"text":"Sep"},{"text":"Oct"},{"text":"Nov"},{"text":"Dec"},{"text":"黑加仑"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0x6ab553"},{"fill":"0x6ab553"},{"fill":"0xcca0db"},{"fill":"0xa217ff"},{"fill":"0xa217ff"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"text":"红加仑"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0x6ab553"},{"fill":"0xcca0db"},{"fill":"0xa217ff"},{"fill":"0xa217ff"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"text":"蓝靛果"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0x6ab553"},{"fill":"0x6ab553"},{"fill":"0xcca0db"},{"fill":"0xa217ff"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"text":"枸杞"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0x6ab553"},{"fill":"0x6ab553"},{"fill":"0xcca0db"},{"fill":"0xa217ff"},{"fill":"0xcca0db"},{"fill":"0xa217ff"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"text":"唐棣"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0x6ab553"},{"fill":"0xcca0db"},{"fill":"0xa217ff"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"text":"野樱莓"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0x6ab553"},{"fill":"0x6ab553"},{"fill":"0x6ab553"},{"fill":"0xcca0db"},{"fill":"0xa217ff"},{"fill":"0xa217ff"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"text":"茶树"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0x6ab553"},{"fill":"0x6ab553"},{"fill":"0x6ab553"},{"fill":"0xcca0db"},{"fill":"0xcca0db"},{"fill":"0xa217ff"},{"fill":"0xa217ff"},{"fill":"0xa217ff"},{"fill":"0x6ab553"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"text":"咖啡树"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0x6ab553"},{"fill":"0xcca0db"},{"fill":"0xcca0db"},{"fill":"0xa217ff"},{"fill":"0xa217ff"},{"fill":"0xa217ff"},{"fill":"0x6ab553"},{"fill":"0x6ab553"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"},{"fill":"0xa8986a"}],"title":"蔓生灌木物候日历","text":"8 种蔓生灌木在一年中的状态变化。","legend":[{"text":"休眠","color":"0xa8986a"},{"text":"健康","color":"0x6ab553"},{"text":"开花","color":"0xcca0db"},{"text":"结果","color":"0xa217ff"}],"columns":12,"first_column_width":45,"column_width":15,"row_height":10,"left_buffer":8,"top_buffer":14,"draw_background":true},{"type":"patchouli:empty"},{"type":"patchouli:text","title":"黑加仑","anchor":"blackcurrant","text":"可在下列区域找到：$(br)$(bold)$(l:tfc:core_mechanics/climate#temperature)温度$(): -12°C - 22°C$(br)$(bold)地下水$(): 140 - 340mm$(br)$(bold)森林覆盖率$(): 2 - 4$(br2)栽培需$(bold)湿度$(): 35 - 85 %。$(br2)形态：$(thing)蔓生$() —— 长成后会向四周与上方长出枝叶。$(br2)黑加仑在 4~5 月生长，6 月开花，7~8 月结果；喜湿润肥沃的河谷与林缘。"},{"type":"tfc:multimultiblock","text":"一丛典型的黑加仑灌木。","multiblocks":[{"pattern":[["X"," "],["Y","Z"],["A","Z"],["0"," "]],"mapping":{"X":"tfcfarmingplus:plant/blackcurrant_bush[lifecycle=dormant,stage=0]","Y":"tfcfarmingplus:plant/blackcurrant_bush[lifecycle=dormant,stage=1]","A":"tfcfarmingplus:plant/blackcurrant_bush[lifecycle=dormant,stage=2]","Z":"tfcfarmingplus:plant/blackcurrant_bush_cane[lifecycle=dormant,facing=east,stage=1]"}},{"pattern":[["X"," "],["Y","Z"],["A","Z"],["0"," "]],"mapping":{"X":"tfcfarmingplus:plant/blackcurrant_bush[lifecycle=healthy,stage=0]","Y":"tfcfarmingplus:plant/blackcurrant_bush[lifecycle=healthy,stage=1]","A":"tfcfarmingplus:plant/blackcurrant_bush[lifecycle=healthy,stage=2]","Z":"tfcfarmingplus:plant/blackcurrant_bush_cane[lifecycle=healthy,facing=east,stage=1]"}},{"pattern":[["X"," "],["Y","Z"],["A","Z"],["0"," "]],"mapping":{"X":"tfcfarmingplus:plant/blackcurrant_bush[lifecycle=flowering,stage=0]","Y":"tfcfarmingplus:plant/blackcurrant_bush[lifecycle=flowering,stage=1]","A":"tfcfarmingplus:plant/blackcurrant_bush[lifecycle=flowering,stage=2]","Z":"tfcfarmingplus:plant/blackcurrant_bush_cane[lifecycle=flowering,facing=east,stage=1]"}},{"pattern":[["X"," "],["Y","Z"],["A","Z"],["0"," "]],"mapping":{"X":"tfcfarmingplus:plant/blackcurrant_bush[lifecycle=fruiting,stage=0]","Y":"tfcfarmingplus:plant/blackcurrant_bush[lifecycle=fruiting,stage=1]","A":"tfcfarmingplus:plant/blackcurrant_bush[lifecycle=fruiting,stage=2]","Z":"tfcfarmingplus:plant/blackcurrant_bush_cane[lifecycle=fruiting,facing=east,stage=1]"}}]},{"type":"patchouli:text","title":"红加仑","anchor":"redcurrant","text":"可在下列区域找到：$(br)$(bold)$(l:tfc:core_mechanics/climate#temperature)温度$(): -10°C - 24°C$(br)$(bold)地下水$(): 140 - 340mm$(br)$(bold)森林覆盖率$(): 2 - 4$(br2)栽培需$(bold)湿度$(): 35 - 85 %。$(br2)形态：$(thing)蔓生$() —— 长成后会向四周与上方长出枝叶。$(br2)红加仑在 5 月生长，6 月开花，7~8 月结果；喜温凉湿润，多见于林缘。"},{"type":"tfc:multimultiblock","text":"一丛典型的红加仑灌木。","multiblocks":[{"pattern":[["X"," "],["Y","Z"],["A","Z"],["0"," "]],"mapping":{"X":"tfcfarmingplus:plant/redcurrant_bush[lifecycle=dormant,stage=0]","Y":"tfcfarmingplus:plant/redcurrant_bush[lifecycle=dormant,stage=1]","A":"tfcfarmingplus:plant/redcurrant_bush[lifecycle=dormant,stage=2]","Z":"tfcfarmingplus:plant/redcurrant_bush_cane[lifecycle=dormant,facing=east,stage=1]"}},{"pattern":[["X"," "],["Y","Z"],["A","Z"],["0"," "]],"mapping":{"X":"tfcfarmingplus:plant/redcurrant_bush[lifecycle=healthy,stage=0]","Y":"tfcfarmingplus:plant/redcurrant_bush[lifecycle=healthy,stage=1]","A":"tfcfarmingplus:plant/redcurrant_bush[lifecycle=healthy,stage=2]","Z":"tfcfarmingplus:plant/redcurrant_bush_cane[lifecycle=healthy,facing=east,stage=1]"}},{"pattern":[["X"," "],["Y","Z"],["A","Z"],["0"," "]],"mapping":{"X":"tfcfarmingplus:plant/red